  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Fast track to AI-powered process automation",
    "splashDescription": "This connector enables seamless integration of NVIDIA AI chat and completion APIs into Camunda-based business processes. It allows users to dynamically invoke multiple AI models directly from BPMN process models by providing inputs such as model name and prompt. It supports a wide range of use cases, including content generation, customer interaction automation, and intelligent process orchestration. Additionally, it provides access to a variety of AI models, including free models or trial credits, enabling cost-effective experimentation.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/795294/overview/img4124654465262150472.png?930fe5083241b45d470bc85c7a659e72",
